 "summary": "The LM317A is a three-pin positive linear regulator whose output is set between 1.2 V and 37 V by two external resistors. It delivers more than 1.5 A and holds 1.25 V between its output and adjust pins. Thermal shutdown, short-circuit current limiting and safe-area protection of the pass transistor are built in. It comes in SOT-223, TO-220, TO-220F2, TO-252, TO-263 and TO-263-3.",
